83
00:07:04.444 --> 00:07:10.788
NARRATOR: The edge case reveals the boundary
of the claim without discarding the useful

84
00:07:10.788 --> 00:07:11.694
core idea.

85
00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:17.670
NARRATOR: Use Connecting to Course
Requirements and Projects to diagnose a

86
00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:21.931
